message: "If you use the Large Labor Model dataset or methodology, please cite it as below. The dataset is CC BY 4.0; the code in this repository is MIT (see LICENSE)."
type: dataset
title: "Large Labor Model"
abstract: >
  An interactive research and art project mapping AI's technical capability to
  replace human labor across 13 territories of work, from 1800 to 2041. Tracks
  two layers — labor shares (workforce distribution by sector) and replaceability
  (technical capability of commercially available AI/robotics) — and the gap
  between them.
